{"sourceUrl":"https://as.nju.edu.cn/c5/f0/c11322a837104/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:39.369448+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://as.nju.edu.cn/c5/f0/c11322a837104/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>为</span></span><span>加强全国高校大气科学领域青年学子之间的交流</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>南京大学大气科学学院将于</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月在</span></span><span>南京大学</span><span><span>举行</span></span><span>“全国大气科学优秀大学生开放日活动”，活动面向全国招收大气科学学科以及相关学科的优秀本科生，即日起开放活动报名</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、招生</span></span></strong><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p><p><span><span>本次开放日活动计划招</span></span><span>收</span><span><span>人数为</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>人</span></span><span>（</span><span>含本校</span><span>）</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、时间和地点</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span><span>0</span></span><span>日在南京大学仙林校区大气</span><span>楼</span><span>举行。</span></p><p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>报名</span></strong><strong><span><span>和</span></span></strong><strong><span>选拔</span></strong></p><p><span><span>（一）申请资格</span></span></p><p><span>学习成绩优秀并且</span><span><span>对大气科学</span></span><span>具有</span><span><span>浓厚兴趣</span></span><span>的</span><span><span>三年级本科生</span></span><span>，具有良好的英语听说读写能力。</span></p><p><span><span>（二）</span></span><span>报名方式</span></p><p><span><span>即日起至</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>29</span></span><span><span>日，有意向参加开放日活动的同学，请完成报名流程。并实名申请加入</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>南大大气科学开放日</span><span>活动</span><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span></span><span><span>971084684</span></span><span><span>。联系人：李老师，联系电话：</span><span>025-896825</span></span><span>75</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>报名网址：</span></p><p><span><span>https://table.nju.edu.cn/dtable/forms/d6f973be-ec92-45be-8b41-5706718aec0a/</span><span>，请准确如实填写个人信息（请务必填全所有信息并上传附件，附件内容如下，请提前准备好。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、个人简介</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、身份证正反面（排版在同一页</span></span><span><span>A4</span><span>纸</span></span><span>）</span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>、学生证封面和个人信息页</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>、本科阶段成绩单及排名证明（院系或教务处盖章）</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span><span>、英语水平证明材料（四六级证书、托福、雅思、</span><span>GRE</span><span>等，须与个人填写的信息相匹配）</span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span><span>、荣誉获奖证明材料（如有多项，请选择</span><span>3</span><span>项代表性获奖证书，合成一个</span><span>pdf</span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span><span>、学术能力证明材料（如有多项，请选择</span><span>3</span><span>项代表性成果，合成一个</span><span>pdf</span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）</span></span><span>选拔</span></p><p><span>报名材料的审核和选拔将于</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日前结束，参加开放日活动学生名单将在我院网站上公布（</span><span>as</span></span><span>.nju.edu.cn</span><span>），不再另行通知。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>注意事项：</span></p><p><span>申请者应保证所提交材料信息的真实性、有效性、完整性，如因不实信息造成的后果完全由本人承担。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span></span></span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://as.nju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://as.nju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/4f/36/1031f0b04e578517376a14a735c3/edd82117-d6a9-4b92-bb60-9c3bca532ee3.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件：南京大学2026年“全国大气科学优秀大学生开放日活动”日程安排.doc\">附件：南京大学2026年“全国大气科学优秀大学生开放日活动”日程安排.doc</a><span><span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"927c1ceba73b0b34b9cb1a4ab1cea5ea49dafc313f38b95cb49ae1e62e5c0b45","textLength":780,"sourceSha256":"58c55c6f7a8f358426ef27e2e01f5d3c8fdf91ac0d622a624502e38ba58cdbfd","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ce728db6f5db23166664","title":"2026年南京大学大气科学学院2026年“全国大气科学优秀大学生开放日活动”的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:39.369448+00:00"}
